<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86948" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόδηλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clear</i> or <i>manifest
				in front</i> or <i>beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1789
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1 ii4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				15.30
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβολὴ π. ἥτις γίνοιτ᾽ ἂν ἁρμόζουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				190
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π. [φόβοι</span>]
				<i>foreseen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1117a19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				3.19
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μὲν ὄντος π. τοῦ δὲ ἀγνοουμένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					6.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ μὲν ἦν π. τὰ μέλλοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.196
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἵλοντο θανάτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.54.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόδηλον ἥδη ἦν, ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.4.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				238b
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>evident,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ τυφλῷ, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φασι</span>, πρόδηλον</span> Polystr.<i><span class="en">
				p.8
			</span></i> W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόδηλα γάρ [ἐστι], ὅτι . . μέλλουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ προδήλου</span> from <i>a
				place in sight, in full view,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1429
			</span></i>(lyr.). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.182
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Oth.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανεῖν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1311
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδηλωτικός</span>
			, c. gen., Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				92.22
			</span></i>,al.</div>
